* The concatenation of two duplicate-free words with disjoint entries has no repeats (Lean: List.nodup_append).

s1::simpll |- ( ( ( V e. Word NN0 /\ W e. Word NN0 ) /\ ( ( Fun `' V /\ Fun `' W ) /\ ( ran V i^i ran W ) = (/) ) ) -> V e. Word NN0 )
